    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40201" root="نفد" body-key="n">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَفِدَ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَفَدَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَفَادٌ</span> (S, A, L, Msb, K)
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَفَدٌ</span>, (L, K,) <i>It</i> (a thing, S, &amp;c.) <i>passed
away and came to an end; became spent, exhausted,</i> or <i>consumed; failed entirely; ceased;</i>
syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَنِى</span> (S, A, L, Msb, K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ذَهَبَ</span> (S, L,
K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِنْقَطَعَ</span>. (L, Msb.)

